  "note": "Srisailam Dam’s 511 m gravity crossing, twelve closed radial gate assemblies, tapered spillway piers, steel maintenance walk, stilling apron, solid wings and the right-bank powerhouse. The signed vertical origin is 250.053237 m. The crest is fixed at 275.54 m, sill at 252.98 m and foundation at 132.28 m. The design fixture uses 269.75 m full pool and an illustrative 190 m tailwater. Preview places the authored base at the recorded absolute sea-level elevation; local tide and terrain resolution remain host-dependent."
